  <meta name="apple-itunes-app" content="app-id=375380948, app-argument=https://apps.apple.com/us/app/yalla-group-voice-chat-rooms/id1091902866" id="ember26523083" class="ember-view">

  <script name="schema:software-application" id="ember26523085" class="ember-view" type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SoftwareApplication","name":"Yalla - Group Voice Chat Rooms","description":"Yalla is the No.1 Live Group Voice Talking and Entertaining Community. Voice Chat and play games with people from nearby or all over the world.\r\n\r\nMeet new friends is never easier:\r\nChoose group voice rooms from THOUSANDS live rooms daily, filter rooms by Countries or Topics. 50+ Countries has already been covered, while tons of topics are available to choose.\r\n\r\nParty with friends with no distances:\r\nGroup voice talking with friends no matter where they are, broadcasting your favorite musics inside the room, singing karaokes together, playing a range of games directly in group chat. Let's get the party started.\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n\r\nTOTALLY FREE — Enjoy free live voice chat over 3G, 4G, LTE or Wi-Fi.\r\n\r\nPUBLIC CHAT ROOMS  — Browse THOUSANDS live chat rooms from NEARBY or AROUND THE WORLD that cover thousands of topics. \r\n\r\nPRIVATE CONVERSATIONS — Start private one-on-one text and voice conversations with your friends from anywhere in the world.\r\n\r\nCHAT GAMES -- Play games together directly in your chat group!\r\n\r\nVIRTUAL GIFTS — Stunning animated gifts can be sent out to express your love.\r\n\r\nSHARE and FOLLOW -- Share your favorite ROOMS on Facebook, Twitter, Instagram, Snapchat and more, inviting friends and new followers.\r\n\r\nFollow us to get the latest news, updates and events:\r\nFacebook: facebook.com/yalla2016/\r\nTwitter: twitter.com/yalladotlive\r\nWebsite: www.yalla.live\r\n\r\nDear YALLA users, your feedback and suggestions are welcomed to : support@yalla.live","screenshot":["https://is4-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple113/v4/ea/78/19/ea78198b-1965-1154-f46b-6bfe3395fe31/mzl.pzeslqiw.png/300x0w.jpg","https://is3-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple123/v4/e2/b3/08/e2b3085f-e981-324b-4b2c-9a4abf3511e5/mzl.djgobldx.png/300x0w.jpg","https://is4-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple113/v4/39/0f/9d/390f9d7f-d563-9719-9a7b-ecedcfdf68b7/pr_source.png/300x0w.jpg","https://is4-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple113/v4/05/2c/85/052c8529-0d9e-b1aa-6586-d1550915457f/mzl.fyiqzxlb.png/300x0w.jpg","https://is5-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple113/v4/8f/7c/2a/8f7c2a9e-95c8-b6e2-525a-d5bc6ed847fc/mzl.ylhhfmzc.png/300x0w.jpg","https://is2-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple123/v4/02/23/c5/0223c509-1ab3-89d5-4c79-8d34844ce207/mzl.qbssbtsy.png/300x0w.jpg","https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple113/v4/af/ab/51/afab51b2-9761-4d0e-5833-b58a9ae7461d/mzl.ewzhpkpa.png/300x0w.jpg"],"image":"https://is4-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple123/v4/14/03/5c/14035c67-93f0-bf63-846e-21a4ac8e1806/AppIcon-Yalla-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-0-85-220-0-7.png/1200x630wa.png","applicationCategory":"Entertainment","datePublished":"2016-04-19","operatingSystem":"Requires iOS 9.0 or later. Compatible with iPhone, iPad, and iPod touch.","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Yalla Technology FZ-LLC","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/developer/yalla-technology-fz-llc/id1444567250"},"aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","ratingValue":4.2,"reviewCount":3399},"offers":{"@type":"Offer","category":"free","price":0,"priceCurrency":"USD"}}
</script>
