      <p dir=false data-test-bidi>1. Room owners can open 10 mics in the room.<br />2. Room owners can invite users to become members for free.<br />3. Room owners&#39; golden badges will be displayed in the room list.<br />4. &quot;Yalla Billionare&quot; list is newly added; top users will get honor badges.<br />5. A new room type is added.<br />6. Other performance improvements<br /></p>

  


