<div class="we-customer-review__header we-customer-review__header--user">
  <span dir="ltr" id="ember26523178" class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line ember-view we-customer-review__user">  Annaluiza Surgeon
</span>

  <span class="we-customer-review__separator">, </span>

  <time data-test-customer-review-date datetime="2019-06-07T17:00:02.000Z" aria-label="June 7, 2019" class="we-customer-review__date" >06/07/2019</time>
</div>

<h3 dir="ltr" id="we-customer-review-60137" class="we-truncate we-truncate--single-line ember-view we-customer-review__title">  Perfect for someone without a iPhone!
</h3>

  <blockquote id="ember26523179" class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive ember-view we-customer-review__body">      

      <p dir=false data-test-bidi>I had to resort to this app after an incident with my phone, and i wish i could write a better review. The camera quality is terrible, the echoing is atrocious, and the other person wouldn’t even get my messages or phone calls until about an hour after i originally send them, not to mention the call dropping every 20 minutes despite being connected to the internet. the app is unreliable, look elsewhere.</p>

  


<!----></blockquote>

<!----></div>
              
</div>
          

      </div>
