,"id":"1255739677","attributes":{"deviceFamilies":["iphone","ipod"],"artistId":"359067226","artistName":"LINE Corporation","artistUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/developer/line-corporation/id359067226","kind":"iosSoftware","name":"LINE LIVE: Broadcast your life","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/line-live-broadcast-your-life/id1255739677"},"relationships":{"offers":{"data":[{"type":"offer","id":"st470467"}]},"genres":{"data":[{"type":"genre","id":"st3239"},{"type":"genre","id":"st3635"}]},"artwork":{"data":{"type":"image","id":"st470468"}}}},{"type":"lockup/app","id":"1315586892","attributes":{"deviceFamilies":["iphone","ipad","ipod"],"artistId":"498939707","artistName":"Intigral International FZ-LLC","artistUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/developer/intigral-international-fz-llc/id498939707","kind":"iosSoftware","name":"Jawwy TV","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/jawwy-tv/id1315586892"},"relationships":{"offers":{"data":[{"type":"offer","id":"st3710675"}]},"genres":{"data":[{"type":"genre","id":"st3239"}]},"artwork":{"data":{"type":"image","id":"st3710676"}}}},{"type":"lockup/app","id":"1350783076","attributes":{"deviceFamilies":["iphone","ipad","ipod"],"artistId":"998491570","artistName":"MOBILE ARTS S.A.L OffShore","artistUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/developer/mobile-arts-s-a-l-offshore/id998491570","kind":"iosSoftware","name":"Secret-Box","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/secret-box/id1350783076"},"relationships":{"offers":{"data":[{"type":"offer","id":"st8351142"}]},"genres":{"data":[{"type":"genre","id":"st3239"}]},"artwork":{"data":{"type":"image","id":"st8351143"}}}},{"type":"lockup/app","id":"1384325538","attributes":{"deviceFamilies":["iphone","ipod"],"artistId":"1250771919","artistName":"MOVEFAST Company, K.K.","artistUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/developer/movefast-company-k-k/id1250771919","kind":"iosSoftware","name":"Hakuna Live - Meet and Chat","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/hakuna-live-meet-and-chat/id1384325538"},"relationships":{"offers":{"data":[{"type":"offer","id":"st161301"}]},"genres":{"data":[{"type":"genre","id":"st3239"}]},"artwork":{"data":{"type":"image","id":"st161302"}}}},{"type":"review","id":"st8351131","attributes":{"body":"I am a member for olmos 5years I meet there a lot off friends I love to play friendshop I spend most of the time there I create a lot off profile to spend time with friends there but I want to get more help when we need to solve any problem regarding any account..like right now I have an issue with my profiles I can’t send messages to my friends that sad I don’t want to delete my account I love to spend time with friends but if I can’t then please help me with this problem I really appreciate that and I keep enjoying my time there love love","date":"2019-06-10T02:05:42Z","name":"Levis Absolem","rating":5,"title":"Fantastic App for Friends!","userReviewId":"4292399426","response":{}},"relationships":{}},{"type":"review","id":"st8351132","attributes":{"body":"Like the site been in it few years, like some improvements only thing I can see is make it a lil easier if you’re in a chat room and you go and check out someone's profile that you don't have to go all the way back to getting into the room should be able to just hit an arrow or something to go back to the room. Also need to work on banning people a lil better. Otherwise like the changes so far keep up the great work. Suave_n_debonair.","date":"2019-06-09T17:36:42Z","name":"Duilio Kienle","rating":5,"title":"Five star","userReviewId":"4290563331","response":{}},"relationships":{}},{"type":"review","id":"st8351133","attributes":{"body":"I had to resort to this app after an incident with my phone, and i wish i could write a better review. The camera quality is terrible, the echoing is atrocious, and the other person wouldn’t even get my messages or phone calls until about an hour after i originally send them, not to mention the call dropping every 20 minutes despite being connected to the internet. the app is unreliable, look elsewhere.","date":"2019-06-07T17:00:02Z","name":"Annaluiza Surgeon","rating":5,"title":"Perfect for someone without a iPhone!","userReviewId":"4278818048","response":{}},"relationships":{}},{"type":"review","id":"st8351134","attributes":{"body":"I have never heard of this app until I kept getting strange calls from people saying they got my number off this app. I eventually logged in because all it asks is for your phone number and password (I clicked on forgot password and got a link sent to my phone). They had a whole account set up and were using it to talk to people!!! So whoever was using this account was using my phone number!!! Not cool!!! Stupid teenage kids","date":"2019-06-07T22:29:52Z","name":"Lohgan Bengochea","rating":5,"title":"Blocked","userReviewId":"4280052747","response":{}},"relationships":{}},{"type":"review","id":"st8351135","attributes":{"body":"I seldom write reviews but in this particular manner I must for it infringes upon my character, I enjoyed the app so I became a streamer, I’ve been steaming for 3 days and on my 3rd day I was getting a ton of traction, then suddenly my streamed stopped and I got hit with a permanent suspension for no reason whatsoever, therefore; until this matter is resolved I’m rating the developers not the app, a 1 Star","date":"2019-06-08T17:01:22Z","name":"Ashini Sainthill","rating":5,"title":"I’m sorry but you didn’t text me back because I’m going back home","userReviewId":"4284588460","response":{}},"relationships":{}}]}</script><script type="fastboot/shoebox" id="shoebox-ember-mzstore-meta">{"priceCurrency":"USD","storefrontId":"143441","storefront":"US"}</script><script type="fastboot/shoebox" id="shoebox-metrics-base">{"pageType":"Software","pageId":"1091902866","pageDetails":"Yalla Technology FZ-LLC_Yalla - Group Voice Chat Rooms","page":"Software_1091902866","serverInstance":"2001500","storeFrontHeader":"","language":"1","platformId":"8","platformName":"ItunesPreview","storeFront":"143441","environmentDataCenter":"ST11","pageUrl":"undefined/us/app/yalla-group-voice-chat-rooms/id1091902866"}</script><script type="fastboot/shoebox" id="shoebox-global-elements">{"nav":"\u003caside id=\"ac-gn-segmentbar\" class=\"ac-gn-segmentbar\" lang=\"en-US\" dir=\"ltr\" data-strings=\"{ \u0026apos;exit\u0026apos;: \u0026apos;Exit\u0026apos;, \u0026apos;view\u0026apos;: \u0026apos;{%STOREFRONT%} Store Home\u0026apos;, \u0026apos;segments\u0026apos;: { \u0026apos;smb\u0026apos;: \u0026apos;Business Store Home\u0026apos;, \u0026apos;eduInd\u0026apos;: \u0026apos;Education Store Home\u0026apos;, \u0026apos;other\u0026apos;: \u0026apos;Store Home\u0026apos; } }\"\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\u003cinput type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ac-gn-menustate\" class=\"ac-gn-menustate\"\u003e\n\u003cnav id=\"ac-globalnav\" class=\"no-js\" role=\"navigation\" aria-label=\"Global\" data-hires=\"false\" data-analytics-region=\"global nav\" lang=\"en-US\" dir=\"ltr\" data-store-locale=\"us\" data-store-api=\"//www.apple.com/[storefront]/shop/bag/status\" data-search-locale=\"en_US\" data-search-api=\"//www.apple.com/search-services/suggestions/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cdiv class=\"ac-gn-content\"\u003e\n\t\t\u003cul class=\"ac-gn-header\"\u003e\n\t\t\t\u003cli class=\"ac-gn-item ac-gn-menuicon\"\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\u003clabel class=\"ac-gn-menuicon-label\" for=\"ac-gn-menustate\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003cspan class=\"ac-gn-menuicon-bread ac-gn-menuicon-bread-top\"\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003cspan class=\"ac-gn-menuicon-bread-crust ac-gn-menuicon-bread-crust-top\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003c/span\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003cspan class=\"ac-gn-menuicon-bread ac-gn-menuicon-bread-bottom\"\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u003cspan class=\"ac-gn-menuicon-bread-crust ac-gn-menuicon-bread-crust-bottom\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\t\u003c/span\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\u003c/label\u003e\n\t\t\t\t\u003ca href=\"#ac-gn-menustate\" role=\"button\" class=\"ac-gn-menuanchor ac-gn-menuanchor-open\" id=\"ac-gn